{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"7cbe48711d25c1932ffa512ed1e3a795d46fbb32545d34c8e02010bb57893615","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"3724ff92841254b92e99da8479c957438e22772a6da0d4042cbc389aeeaab889","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e59c510d73660339e3e8ee00c3c87936436d7fd7fb3a28911c876312603fbd64","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"原文 arcane resource burn damage 译成「奥术法力燃烧伤害」，把被燃烧的对象缩成了只有法力。源码 tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/other.lua（sha256 4a12c054…，来源未固定）archery_onhit 调用 DamageType.MANABURN；t-engine4 game/modules/tome/data/damage_types.lua 的 MANABURN projector 调用 target:burnArcaneResources(dam)，class/Actor.lua:7130-7140 会同时燃烧法力、活力、正能量和负能量，并按 max(mana, vim*2, pos*4, neg*4) 造成奥术伤害。建议改为「奥术资源燃烧伤害」或同义译法，保留「资源」的泛指。"}]}